    "All of this can be changed on the Health tab. iOS asks which of the types the app may read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All das kannst du im Tab Gesundheit ändern. iOS fragt, welche Typen die App lesen darf."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
